"summary": "The new version (revision 2) uses more CPU than the previous version, causing throttling. Increase the CPU limit for the 'api' container to 750m to alleviate throttling.",
"hypotheses": [
  {
    "root_cause_class": "new_version_uses_more_cpu",
    "summary": "Throttling_came_with_rollout is true, and revision 2's API uses 88% of its CPU limit vs 45% in revision 1 (ev-rollout_history, ev-revision_health).",
